{"id":46633,"date":"2025-11-17T09:34:06","date_gmt":"2025-11-17T08:34:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sky-race-montejunto-2026-verao\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:05:05","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:05:05","slug":"sky-race-montejunto-verao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sky-race-montejunto-verao\/","title":{"rendered":"Sky Race Montejunto 2026 Ver\u00e3o"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0TURRES TRAIL CLUBE\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0com o apoio da \u00c1rea Protegida da Serra da Montejunto\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0, C\u00e2mara Municipal do Cadaval e FCMP- Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Caravanismo e Montanhismo Portugal , vai levar a efeito a 10\u00ba edi\u00e7\u00e3o\u00a0\u00a0<strong>SkyRace Montejunto\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong>no dia 17 de Maio de 2026\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0. O percurso\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e9 circular, o local de partida,\u00a0\u00a0chegada , secretariado e entrega\u00a0\u00a0de pr\u00e9mios e no\u00a0\u00a0centro interpreta\u00e7\u00e3o ambiental da Serra de Montejunto\u00a0.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Percurso de serra com caracter\u00edsticas t\u00e9cnicas de elevada dificuldade\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0com tr\u00eas \u00a0 \u00a0distancias, 26 km com 2000 d+ , 16 km com\u00a0\u00a0aproximadamente 1200 mt\u00a0\u00a0D+ e 10 km com aprox. 800 mt D+.<br>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50564,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,708,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46633","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-montejunto-cadaval","event_type-caminhada","event_type-skyrunning","event_type-trail","event_type-trail